## Scientific And Domain Assessments

### Full candidate and source-lineage preservation

provenance: supported. Targets: TARGET-025, ORIGINAL-w01::KG26-PROP-175-STRUCTURAL-IDENTITY, ORIGINAL-w01::RS-074-NEW.

All three selected full owner objects retain their identities, chemistry, roles, aliases, rejected labels, source scopes and history. Original edit/create semantics and six source proposals/eight cases remain exact. No ancestor HUMAN evidence is rewritten and no fabricated native origin is introduced.

### Truthful method grade with explicitly agent-authored evidence

consistency: supported. Targets: TARGET-025, ORIGINAL-w01::KG26-PROP-175-STRUCTURAL-IDENTITY, ORIGINAL-w01::RS-074-NEW.

The recorded structural-borax, material-versus-atom sulfur and empirical-versus-molecular oxide adjudications are represented by MANUAL_CURATION method quality. New evidence is LLM_SUGGESTION and history is LLM-assisted; the mapping-quality vocabulary is not the human-only MappingEvidence enum. Diarsenic retains its real exact As2O3 query and related-synonym support. This is the author response to filed findings, not distinct scientific approval.

### Dependency and release limits

ownership: supported. Targets: TARGET-025, ORIGINAL-w01::KG26-PROP-175-STRUCTURAL-IDENTITY, ORIGINAL-w01::RS-074-NEW.

The three already-planned UW child corrections are explicit prerequisites for Borax installation; their bytes are not newly authored or approved here. No source, role, inherited occurrence, supported-export or companion hold is cleared.

