## Limits And Additional Notes

- The known standalone Borax partonomy failure is preserved; installation requires the exact three original UW dependency corrections or a separately reviewed authentic successor.
- Only original method, new evidence and new history change. All prior source/allotrope/lot/stock/quantity/role/release holds persist; original MANUAL_CURATION evidence authorship is not changed.
- W09 original serialized native pair has a separately filed transport defect and is not relabelled as passing. Its scientific ledgers and C qualification remain distinct.
- Initial self-review validation refused target kind record, which belongs to the review document but not ReviewTarget; no review was saved. The new self-review uses source targets with identical candidate bytes and retains the failed script/log.
- Original compose.py failed before any final candidate write because its private parent was absent; compose-v2 created the parent and reused verified identical frozen inputs. Original failed verify.py assumed an isolated overlay would have no dependency failures; verify-v2 retains the exact known failure and binds the already-planned UW closure. Both raw attempts remain visible.
- The native row comparison uses a bounded immutable A842-plus-six overlay, actual KG gzip and cached official labels; no providers or final stamp replay. It does not substitute for independent full corrected-campaign row review.
- The local Git snapshot only makes this private author review honestly saveable with exact captured inputs; it is not a production commit, fresh reviewer identity or application acceptance.
- Root filed #1201 comment6724230173 before candidate authoring. No issue was closed and no previous finding terminal disposition was fabricated.

